  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "\"Our destiny is a promise that has waited a thousand years.\" \n\nYeorangdang tells the story of love and sacrifice that has been revived in Andong over a millennium. It follows a woman who devoted everything to protect the king of Goryeo and the warrior who endured countless reincarnations for her sake. Their bond transcends time and is rekindled in modern-day Andong.\n\nAmidst the invasion of the Red Turbans, the woman sacrifices herself to protect King Gongmin, leading to a reunion of two souls who have longed for each other. Their story blooms along the banks of the Nakdong River, shining with miraculous moments born from years of waiting.\n\nYeorangdang depicts those who carry memories of their past lives under the night sky of Andong, recognizing each other and finally realizing their love. \n\nIt is a profound tale that conveys the essence of fate and love.\n\nOriginal Webtoon: [Kakao](https://page.kakao.com/content/65508452)",
